<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1443431915"/></metadata></head><body dur="5:02.093"><div begin="35.723" end="1:05.796" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="35.723" end="42.410" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.723" end="36.757">前尘往事</span><span begin="36.757" end="37.275">成</span><span begin="37.275" end="37.592">云</span><span begin="37.592" end="38.259">烟</span> <span begin="38.658" end="40.740">消散在彼</span><span begin="40.740" end="41.210">此</span><span begin="41.210" end="41.477">眼</span><span begin="41.477" end="42.410">前</span></p><p begin="43.539" end="50.470" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.539" end="44.547">就连说过</span><span begin="44.547" end="45.033">了</span><span begin="45.033" end="45.315">再</span><span begin="45.315" end="45.987">见</span> <span begin="46.790" end="47.390">也看不</span><span begin="47.390" end="47.972">见</span><span begin="47.972" end="48.521">你有</span><span begin="48.521" end="49.054">些</span><span begin="49.054" end="49.321">哀</span><span begin="49.321" end="50.470">怨</span></p><p begin="51.983" end="58.224" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.983" end="52.909">给我</span><span begin="52.909" end="53.661">的一</span><span begin="53.661" end="54.346">切</span> <span begin="54.808" end="55.392">你不</span><span begin="55.392" end="56.807">过是在</span><span begin="56.807" end="57.192">敷</span><span begin="57.192" end="58.224">衍</span></p><p begin="1:00.085" end="1:05.796" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.085" end="1:00.537">你笑</span><span begin="1:00.537" end="1:01.040">得</span><span begin="1:01.274" end="1:01.807">越</span><span begin="1:01.807" end="1:02.074">无</span><span begin="1:02.074" end="1:02.528">邪</span> <span begin="1:02.642" end="1:03.297">我就会</span><span begin="1:03.297" end="1:04.212">爱你爱得</span><span begin="1:04.212" end="1:04.780">更</span><span begin="1:04.780" end="1:05.113">狂</span><span begin="1:05.113" end="1:05.796">野</span></p></div><div begin="1:06.283" end="1:37.380" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:06.283" end="1:09.792" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.283" end="1:07.123">总在刹那</span><span begin="1:07.123" end="1:07.744">间</span> <span begin="1:08.057" end="1:09.091">有一些瞭</span><span begin="1:09.091" end="1:09.792">解</span></p><p begin="1:10.129" end="1:13.651" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.129" end="1:11.115">说过的话</span><span begin="1:11.115" end="1:11.547">不</span><span begin="1:11.547" end="1:12.115">可能</span><span begin="1:12.115" end="1:12.566">会</span><span begin="1:12.566" end="1:12.865">实</span><span begin="1:12.865" end="1:13.651">现</span></p><p begin="1:14.085" end="1:17.823" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.085" end="1:15.039">就在一转</span><span begin="1:15.039" end="1:15.621">眼</span> <span begin="1:15.991" end="1:16.941">发现你的</span><span begin="1:16.941" end="1:17.823">脸</span></p><p begin="1:18.053" end="1:21.687" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.053" end="1:18.962">已经陌生</span><span begin="1:18.962" end="1:19.677">不会</span><span begin="1:19.677" end="1:19.946">再</span><span begin="1:19.946" end="1:20.477">像</span><span begin="1:20.477" end="1:20.778">从</span><span begin="1:20.778" end="1:21.687">前</span></p><p begin="1:21.928" end="1:25.977" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.928" end="1:23.926">我的世界</span><span begin="1:23.926" end="1:24.326">开</span><span begin="1:24.326" end="1:24.643">始</span><span begin="1:24.643" end="1:25.126">下</span><span begin="1:25.126" end="1:25.977">雪</span></p><p begin="1:26.319" end="1:29.940" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.319" end="1:26.811">冷得</span><span begin="1:26.811" end="1:27.262">让我</span><span begin="1:27.262" end="1:27.779">无法</span><span begin="1:27.779" end="1:28.246">多</span><span begin="1:28.246" end="1:28.544">爱</span><span begin="1:28.544" end="1:29.062">一</span><span begin="1:29.062" end="1:29.940">天</span></p><p begin="1:30.281" end="1:37.380" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.281" end="1:30.830">冷得</span><span begin="1:30.830" end="1:31.748">连隐</span><span begin="1:31.748" end="1:32.230">藏</span><span begin="1:32.230" end="1:32.497">的</span><span begin="1:32.497" end="1:33.049">遗</span><span begin="1:33.049" end="1:34.023">憾</span><span begin="1:34.430" end="1:34.796">都</span><span begin="1:34.796" end="1:36.250">那么地</span><span begin="1:36.250" end="1:36.513">明</span><span begin="1:36.513" end="1:37.380">显</span></p></div><div begin="1:37.662" end="1:56.972" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:37.662" end="1:42.094" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.662" end="1:38.134">我和</span><span begin="1:38.134" end="1:38.633">你吻</span><span begin="1:38.633" end="1:39.788">别</span><span begin="1:39.788" end="1:40.239">在</span><span begin="1:40.239" end="1:40.471">无</span><span begin="1:40.471" end="1:41.071">人</span><span begin="1:41.071" end="1:41.305">的</span><span begin="1:41.305" end="1:42.094">街</span></p><p begin="1:42.387" end="1:45.411" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.387" end="1:42.597">让</span><span begin="1:42.597" end="1:43.521">风痴笑我</span><span begin="1:43.521" end="1:43.949">不</span><span begin="1:43.949" end="1:44.232">能</span><span begin="1:44.232" end="1:44.765">拒</span><span begin="1:44.765" end="1:45.411">绝</span></p><p begin="1:45.577" end="1:50.048" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.577" end="1:45.960">我和</span><span begin="1:45.960" end="1:46.442">你吻</span><span begin="1:46.442" end="1:47.645">别</span><span begin="1:47.714" end="1:48.213">在</span><span begin="1:48.213" end="1:48.496">狂</span><span begin="1:48.496" end="1:48.962">乱</span><span begin="1:48.962" end="1:49.248">的</span><span begin="1:49.248" end="1:50.048">夜</span></p><p begin="1:50.214" end="1:56.972" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.214" end="1:50.464">我</span><span begin="1:50.464" end="1:50.972">的</span><span begin="1:50.972" end="1:51.809">心</span><span begin="1: